| encrypted-data-zone-and-crawler-module | Captures the pipeline's storage/catalog/crawler infrastructure without promoting provider resources. | object-storage | aws / s3; terraform:aws_s3_bucket | data-zone-bucket: `repository://repository-serverless-data-pipelines-demo-95c2a8f15f93/s3_bucket/main.tf#L1-L15`<br>data-zone-catalog: `repository://repository-serverless-data-pipelines-demo-95c2a8f15f93/s3_bucket/main.tf#L17-L19`<br>data-zone-crawler: `repository://repository-serverless-data-pipelines-demo-95c2a8f15f93/s3_bucket/main.tf#L21-L35` |

